extracted to  dist\app\20261029-002027
netd there    300aac2531dcdf68be450682604097fe03ca528479cfb00846f29374af357d1a
supervisor --check on the extracted tree: exit 0, no MISSING lines
plan: chanseq social [slot 8=6], AWDL_CHANSEQ=social, awdld -c 149 -s 2 -j 400 -v, merge on (join_us=400)

## why this default
Q41 measured the default configuration (social + merge) at 31.91 s / 0.9231 MB/s with this
netd, the fastest of five runs tonight. Merged frames are only harmful at fixed 149
(CRC 40.3%); at social they are 15.8% and the phone reaches 826 frames/s. So the
supervisor default stays unchanged and the rebuilt package simply ships it.

